  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Ownership Boundaries - CNF",
  "description": "Data Type: Boundaries; Cover type layer with area of polygon in square meters, perimeter of polygon in ownership code including conveyances and selected lands. Conveyed lands depicted are primarily conveyances to the State and Native Corporations. Smaller parcels are being added as time and information become available. Scale is 1:63,360/40 acres.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
